      <graphic xml:id="m-df026f96-65f5-471f-9cd1-3fa9f6ef89c2" target="2135_original_image.tiff" /><zone xml:id="m-099b71f5-f0c5-4b80-813a-3e0e4398e1e3" ulx="784" uly="234" lrx="1628" lry="317" /><zone xml:id="m-2b8d164e-5fd7-42c8-bfa8-88c6a92fb56b" ulx="197" uly="354" lrx="2328" lry="469" /><zone xml:id="m-da32a6fd-ddc7-425d-b5d8-0edf8f700f71" ulx="119" uly="451" lrx="921" lry="559" /><zone xml:id="m-41014142-16f3-48ab-9d8c-92d49db542e8" ulx="195" uly="573" lrx="2326" lry="669" /><zone xml:id="m-6305806e-f664-4dad-8558-91ad637af8f0" ulx="115" uly="671" lrx="1102" lry="765" /><zone xml:id="m-913ab41d-c6d4-452d-afec-21a69c5662ec" ulx="192" uly="787" lrx="2328" lry="902" /><zone xml:id="m-ffdb83d6-0faf-4d85-97ed-4064f162170a" ulx="115" uly="899" lrx="1522" lry="1003" /><zone xml:id="m-8ad98b69-c760-4b39-a642-94682e8a12a9" ulx="195" uly="1012" lrx="2333" lry="1113" /><zone xml:id="m-dad06b74-2c5e-4fdf-abbf-ac0067ddd241" ulx="122" uly="1118" lrx="850" lry="1200" /><zone xml:id="m-4e4b2a36-6021-4113-8339-f2a16e132f6e" ulx="187" uly="1219" lrx="2333" lry="1334" /><zone xml:id="m-3bfe551f-b726-49a7-bb99-1ddaddcb982c" ulx="119" uly="1320" lrx="2239" lry="1419" /></surface></facsimile><body>
    <mdiv type="solesmes">
      <score>
        <section>
          <pb xml:id="m-03f034c6-bf9a-4786-9820-dc77792fdcb7" n="2135" facs="#m-aa56607d-475a-48c3-8965-af9fad4a8f29" /><div xml:id="m-1daca53d-5fab-42b8-bfa2-2430610aeb1f">
            <lg xml:id="m-a0364bd7-a4e0-4cb9-b5c8-d17e8fae8aa6">
              <l xml:id="m-de4707d8-292f-4563-985c-632bc3aa114b" facs="#m-099b71f5-f0c5-4b80-813a-3e0e4398e1e3" label="ambiguous">Tract in a Psalm-tone</l><l xml:id="m-b3a0feb0-03c6-4900-84ad-56dd62253ca7" facs="#m-2b8d164e-5fd7-42c8-bfa8-88c6a92fb56b" label="lyrics-like">V. 9. In mánibus portábunt te, * ne unquam offéndas ad</l><l xml:id="m-bdc00535-ff12-462d-826f-ddb6898f9fbe" facs="#m-da32a6fd-ddc7-425d-b5d8-0edf8f700f71" label="lyrics-like">lápidem pédem túum.</l><l xml:id="m-28c4b4d6-57be-45f0-aca9-57f17259466e" facs="#m-41014142-16f3-48ab-9d8c-92d49db542e8" label="lyrics-like">V. 10. Super áspidem et basilíscum ambulábis, * et concul¬</l><l xml:id="m-3bd949a0-3af8-4b45-91f7-84b10cb704d7" facs="#m-6305806e-f664-4dad-8558-91ad637af8f0" label="lyrics-like">cábis leónem et dracónem.</l><l xml:id="m-1d689c81-2247-48c3-bbd1-b9056296868e" facs="#m-913ab41d-c6d4-452d-afec-21a69c5662ec" label="lyrics-like">V. 11. Quóniam in me sperávit,t liberábo éum:“prótegam</l><l xml:id="m-e324caba-cb31-4792-b127-81563f851a42" facs="#m-ffdb83d6-0faf-4d85-97ed-4064f162170a" label="lyrics-like">éum, quóniam cognóvit nómen méum.</l><l xml:id="m-bd55cf61-ca90-4f4c-ac21-0d0e6552ca71" facs="#m-8ad98b69-c760-4b39-a642-94682e8a12a9" label="lyrics-like">V. 12. Invocábit me, et égo exáudiam éum:“cum ipso</l><l xml:id="m-2bb6d9ee-6893-4430-abf1-f1f86960490d" facs="#m-dad06b74-2c5e-4fdf-abbf-ac0067ddd241" label="lyrics-like">sum in tribulatióne.</l><l xml:id="m-85148d3c-f24e-4cfe-b501-25acaac3da6e" facs="#m-4e4b2a36-6021-4113-8339-f2a16e132f6e" label="lyrics-like">V. 13. Eripiam éum, et glorificábo éum t longitúdine</l><l xml:id="m-dc9034ed-d4f1-4056-8671-14989e13f2af" facs="#m-3bfe551f-b726-49a7-bb99-1ddaddcb982c" label="lyrics-like">diérum adimplébo éum, *et osténdam flli salutáre méum.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>